{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28041","headline":"送顾非熊及第归茅山 · 厉玄","name":"送顾非熊及第归茅山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故山登第去，不似旧归难。\n帆卷江初夜，梅生洞少寒。\n采薇留客饮，折竹扫仙坛。\n名在仪曹籍，何人肯挂冠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"厉玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28041.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28041","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}